      "content": "If the voltage fluctuated seriously, it may cause misoperation of the machine and failure of the electric and electronic parts. Therefore, set the fluctuating rate not to exceed ± 10%."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0444",
